  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Near-end Project Evaluation Final MRLG3</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Switzerland with its longstanding engagement and experience in land and natural resource management will support a last phase of the &#x201C;Mekong Region Land Governance&#x201D; project. This Swiss flagship project will continue to support Alliances of Reform-Actors, including policy-makers and civil society, to improve policy-making environment and implementation toward improved land tenure security for vulnerable family farmers in the Mekong region, particularly in Cambodia, Lao PDR, Myanmar and Vietnam.</narrative>
  </description>
